              "type": "text",
              "text": "To celebrate the outstanding contribution to, and leadership of, the Aga Khan University by President Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, H.I., S.I., a ceremony to honor his achievements was held on behalf of faculty, staff, students and volunteers on Thursday, April 27th, 2006."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On 30 April 2006, Kassim-Lakha stepped down from AKU presidency after decades of successful service."
            }
          ]
        }
